{
  "brand": "Jaunty",
  "site": "https://jaunty.com",
  "source": {
    "kind": "wp_media",
    "site": "https://jaunty.com",
    "link": "\\.pdf$",
    "skip": "(?i)catalog|budtender|training|menu|sell-?sheet"
  },
  "learned": "2026-10-15: jaunty.com/labresults shows one product's reports at a time through a picker; the WordPress media library lists all ~1,000 report PDFs. Lab: Kaycha Labs.",
  "notes": [
    "Filenames are STRAIN-LOT, the lot being J + a 3-letter line code (JYVC vape cart, JIPR, JLQD, JBVC, JYBD, JROC, JCCR, JYHG) then a product code and YYMM: SOUR-DIESEL-JYBD-SDSL-2609.",
    "Some recent filenames carry only the lot (JYVC-AMHZ-2607); the strain then comes from the catalog match on the report itself.",
    "Media titles read 'Strain [Product] LOT' (Rainbow Belts JYVC-RNBT-2608, Orange Swirl Hash Gummies JYHG-OGSW-2607) and carry the strain where the filename has only the lot, so they are tried first.",
    "Lot prefixes name the line (category + lines rules), measured 2026-10-15 by which catalog line each prefix's strains fall in: JYVC Classic cart, JYPM Palms, JROC Live Rosin cart, JBVC Live Resin cart, JLQD Liquid Diamonds, JYBD All-Stars, JYDG Fast-Acting gummies, JYHG Hash gummies, JYRG Live Rosin gummies, JCCR Cold Cure rosin, JIPR Live Rosin Hash Hole, JDRP drops (no line)."
  ],
  "name": [
    {
      "from": "text",
      "match": "^(?P<strain>.+?)\\s+(?P<lot>J[A-Z]{3}-[A-Z0-9]+(?:-[A-Z0-9]+)*?)-?$"
    },
    {
      "from": "file",
      "match": "^(?:Jaunty-)?(?P<strain>.*?[A-Za-z].*?)-?(?P<lot>J[A-Z]{3}(?:-?[A-Z0-9]+)*?)-?(?:-\\d)?\\.pdf$"
    },
    {
      "from": "file",
      "match": "^(?P<strain>[A-Za-z][A-Za-z-]+?)-\\d{4,6}(?:-\\d)?\\.pdf$"
    }
  ],
  "category": [
    {
      "when": {
        "lot": "^JYVC"
      },
      "set": "vaporizers"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "lot": "^JYPM"
      },
      "set": "vaporizers"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "lot": "^JROC"
      },
      "set": "vaporizers"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "lot": "^JBVC"
      },
      "set": "vaporizers"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "lot": "^JLQD"
      },
      "set": "vaporizers"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "lot": "^JYBD"
      },
      "set": "vaporizers"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "lot": "^JYDG"
      },
      "set": "edible"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "lot": "^JYHG"
      },
      "set": "edible"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "lot": "^JYRG"
      },
      "set": "edible"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "lot": "^JCCR"
      },
      "set": "concentrate"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "lot": "^JIPR"
      },
      "set": "preroll"
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "lot": "^JDRP"
      },
      "set": "tinctures"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "when": "(?<![A-Z])JYVC",
      "line": "Classic"
    },
    {
      "when": "(?<![A-Z])JYPM",
      "line": "Palms"
    },
    {
      "when": "(?<![A-Z])JROC",
      "line": "Live Rosin"
    },
    {
      "when": "(?<![A-Z])JBVC",
      "line": "Live Resin"
    },
    {
      "when": "(?<![A-Z])JLQD",
      "line": "Liquid Diamonds"
    },
    {
      "when": "(?<![A-Z])JYBD",
      "line": "All-Stars"
    },
    {
      "when": "(?<![A-Z])JYDG",
      "line": "Fast-Acting"
    },
    {
      "when": "(?<![A-Z])JYHG",
      "line": "Hash"
    },
    {
      "when": "(?<![A-Z])JYRG",
      "line": "Live Rosin"
    },
    {
      "when": "(?<![A-Z])JCCR",
      "line": "Cold Cure"
    },
    {
      "when": "(?<![A-Z])JIPR",
      "line": "Live Rosin Hash Hole"
    },
    {
      "when": "(?<![A-Z])JDRP",
      "line": ""
    }
  ]
}
